WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.562 --> 00:00:04.948
- My goal is to get
every single single woman

00:00:04.948 --> 00:00:06.579
carrying around condoms

00:00:06.579 --> 00:00:08.865
just as they carry around everything else.

00:00:08.865 --> 00:00:10.576
It's like a no brainer

00:00:10.576 --> 00:00:12.859
and I always joke, like, "How do we get people

00:00:12.859 --> 00:00:15.359
to take selfies with condoms?"

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:24.079
I'm Meika Hollender, and I'm
the co-founder of Sustain,

00:00:24.079 --> 00:00:27.056
which is a brand of all natural
sexual wellness products

00:00:27.056 --> 00:00:28.556
marketed to women.

00:00:30.928 --> 00:00:33.705
Only 19% of single sexually active women

00:00:33.705 --> 00:00:35.473
use condoms regularly.

00:00:35.473 --> 00:00:36.978
And one in four college freshmen

00:00:36.978 --> 00:00:40.205
actually gets an STD during
her first year at school.

00:00:40.205 --> 00:00:42.114
And this is a crisis and this is a subject

00:00:42.114 --> 00:00:44.068
that isn't being talked about

00:00:44.068 --> 00:00:46.722
because, when you think
about condoms and lubricant,

00:00:46.722 --> 00:00:50.472
these are products that
can be seen as taboo.

00:00:51.658 --> 00:00:53.331
Women are extremely uncomfortable

00:00:53.331 --> 00:00:55.664
buying and carrying condoms.

00:00:57.003 --> 00:00:59.649
When I go to my peers and
the people that I know,

00:00:59.649 --> 00:01:01.407
they're the worst offenders.

00:01:01.407 --> 00:01:04.099
We're trying to rebrand it a little bit

00:01:04.099 --> 00:01:06.669
and completely empower women to

00:01:06.669 --> 00:01:08.418
take control of their sexual health

00:01:08.418 --> 00:01:10.585
with much better products.

00:01:12.856 --> 00:01:16.653
Most lubricants out there
contain parabens and glycerin

00:01:16.653 --> 00:01:18.529
and petroleum and silicone.

00:01:18.529 --> 00:01:20.606
Our products have none of those things.

00:01:20.606 --> 00:01:22.520
They're aloe and water-based.

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:25.007
It's the only fair trade certified

00:01:25.007 --> 00:01:28.880
carcinogen-free condom
on the market in the U.S.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.693
We are starting a conversation
that needs to be had.

00:01:31.693 --> 00:01:33.937
So, I spend a lot of
time talking to consumers

00:01:33.937 --> 00:01:36.872
about why they not only need
to be using our products,

00:01:36.872 --> 00:01:40.911
but also why they should be
just using condoms in general.

00:01:40.911 --> 00:01:45.078
You should never feel ashamed
for wanting to or having sex.

00:01:46.257 --> 00:01:50.415
But, the reality is,
you're out there for you

00:01:50.415 --> 00:01:51.679
and you need to protect yourself.

00:01:51.679 --> 00:01:53.679
Nobody else is going to.

